(400573, 35102, 10055, '<td valign="top">Contrast is great. Good shot</td>', 'Contrast is great. Good shot', '2003-08-27 02:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(400574, 35196, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is funny. The sharp tacks are placed outside the main focal point, but the flat hammer is inside. Makes me think that there''s an irony intended here. The title suggests the building of your country, and the blood-like colours emphasise the blood and sweat that went into the making. Compositionally well-balanced. Your use of light is effective. However, I don''t feel any overall "wow" here. 6</td>', 'This is funny. The sharp tacks are placed outside the main focal point, but the flat hammer is inside. Makes me think that there''s an irony intended here. The title suggests the building of your country, and the blood-like colours emphasise the blood and sweat that went into the making. Compositionally well-balanced. Your use of light is effective. However, I don''t feel any overall "wow" here. 6', '2003-08-27 02:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(400575, 35141, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and 3D feel to it, good lighting...but its not the most interesting subject.</td>', 'Nice DOF and 3D feel to it, good lighting...but its not the most interesting subject.', '2003-08-27 02:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(400577, 35129, 9550, '<td valign="top">I almost did the same shot. glad i didnt, yours id better. I would have croped the space out in the top L corner and the bottom R corner.</td>', 'I almost did the same shot. glad i didnt, yours id better. I would have croped the space out in the top L corner and the bottom R corner.', '2003-08-27 02:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(400578, 35246, 9073, '<td valign="top">nice dof. nice colours. good composition. overall a nice shot but not "wow"</td>', 'nice dof. nice colours. good composition. overall a nice shot but not "wow"', '2003-08-27 02:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(400581, 35122, 6405, '<td valign="top">The light in background screwed the beautiful composition,8 from me!</td>', 'The light in background screwed the beautiful composition,8 from me!', '2003-08-27 02:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(400583, 35190, 3554, '<td valign="top">A lot of good things in this shot. I like the composition, the paper fanning out, and the cropping.  No one part of it feels in focus though and the lighting hurts it. I''d like to see better lighting to show off the different colors.</td>', 'A lot of good things in this shot. I like the composition, the paper fanning out, and the cropping.  No one part of it feels in focus though and the lighting hurts it. I''d like to see better lighting to show off the different colors.', '2003-08-27 02:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(400585, 34663, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective good DOF and light,boring subject,8 from me!</td>', 'Nice perspective good DOF and light,boring subject,8 from me!', '2003-08-27 02:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(400586, 34785, 10263, '<td valign="top">This one makes a statement. Quite controversial. It will be interesting reading the comments later. I think a little more contrast might have worked better but its a great shot.</td>', 'This one makes a statement. Quite controversial. It will be interesting reading the comments later. I think a little more contrast might have worked better but its a great shot.', '2003-08-27 02:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(400588, 35060, 9073, '<td valign="top">To emphasise the fun here, I wish that that bar behind was placed to look as if it was going through the subject like an arrow. Or take it out. Good exposure on the skin - the lighting works well. But, really, there''s no facial expression which shouts "arrghhghgh", more of a pitiful look.</td>', 'To emphasise the fun here, I wish that that bar behind was placed to look as if it was going through the subject like an arrow. Or take it out. Good exposure on the skin - the lighting works well. But, really, there''s no facial expression which shouts "arrghhghgh", more of a pitiful look.', '2003-08-27 02:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(400589, 35157, 3554, '<td valign="top">Generally it''s a good shot but I think a slightly different angle would have worked better. There''s not quite enough in focus to pull this off. Perhaps if the focal point was lit more brightly?</td>', 'Generally it''s a good shot but I think a slightly different angle would have worked better. There''s not quite enough in focus to pull this off. Perhaps if the focal point was lit more brightly?', '2003-08-27 02:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(400590, 35138, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great use of the red towel... makes you think of the porsche sports red.  :-)  beautiful tools also... nice job of the desaturation, although it makes the car engine look a bit blah.  pretty nice though.</td>', 'Great use of the red towel... makes you think of the porsche sports red.  :-)  beautiful tools also... nice job of the desaturation, although it makes the car engine look a bit blah.  pretty nice though.', '2003-08-27 02:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(400591, 34550, 9462, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA! I knew someone would squeeze a flower in here somehow! 8</td>', 'HAHAHA! I knew someone would squeeze a flower in here somehow! 8', '2003-08-27 02:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(400595, 35204, 3554, '<td valign="top">Amusing. Would be better if the broom were angled so that it didnt get in the way of the horses.</td>', 'Amusing. Would be better if the broom were angled so that it didnt get in the way of the horses.', '2003-08-27 02:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(400597, 35157, 11432, '<td valign="top">Interesting Depth Of Field, took me a while to figure out what it was.</td>', 'Interesting Depth Of Field, took me a while to figure out what it was.', '2003-08-27 02:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(400598, 35073, 9073, '<td valign="top">SImple, clean, effective.</td>', 'SImple, clean, effective.', '2003-08-27 02:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(400599, 35171, 3554, '<td valign="top">On the right track with this one. A shallow DOF and a little better lighting would have paid big dvidends. The only thing I really dislike is the border. It really doesn''t "go" with the shot. If it were orange and matched the color of the orange on the dials that would have been better...</td>', 'On the right track with this one. A shallow DOF and a little better lighting would have paid big dvidends. The only thing I really dislike is the border. It really doesn''t "go" with the shot. If it were orange and matched the color of the orange on the dials that would have been better...', '2003-08-27 02:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(400605, 34932, 7969, '<td valign="top">I hope people see the time you took in staging this shot.  I gave an extra point for the composition.  would like to see an outtake without the screwdriver.</td>', 'I hope people see the time you took in staging this shot.  I gave an extra point for the composition.  would like to see an outtake without the screwdriver.', '2003-08-27 02:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(400606, 34856, 4514, '<td valign="top">Trying to see how a Micrometer makes the Cut.  LOL</td>', 'Trying to see how a Micrometer makes the Cut.  LOL', '2003-08-27 02:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(400607, 34629, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  I would personally love to try and shoot this bad boy with my pro light.  Wonder what kind of dramatic effect I could produce.  <br/></td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  I would personally love to try and shoot this bad boy with my pro light.  Wonder what kind of dramatic effect I could produce.  ', '2003-08-27 02:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(400608, 35111, 9073, '<td valign="top">the use of line created by light is good, but could be better if used to either support or conflict with the lines of the saw</td>', 'the use of line created by light is good, but could be better if used to either support or conflict with the lines of the saw', '2003-08-27 02:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
