(400628, 34906, 3554, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the lighting, focus and colors. One of the best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the lighting, focus and colors. One of the best I''ve seen so far.', '2003-08-27 02:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
