(400635, 34969, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think simply calling it "Gunsmith" would have been better. Might have tried cropping a bit more of the left and bottom. Nice grayscale though and certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'I think simply calling it "Gunsmith" would have been better. Might have tried cropping a bit more of the left and bottom. Nice grayscale though and certainly meets the challenge.', '2003-08-27 02:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(400637, 35164, 4967, '<td valign="top">This looks like an Alecia shot... I believe this is the lighting she/you always use.  Very nice.  I like it, love the DOF... very pretty.  There is some stuff on the floor or tabletop or whatever that is distracting, overall though, a nice shot... -9-</td>', 'This looks like an Alecia shot... I believe this is the lighting she/you always use.  Very nice.  I like it, love the DOF... very pretty.  There is some stuff on the floor or tabletop or whatever that is distracting, overall though, a nice shot... -9-', '2003-08-27 02:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(400638, 35247, 10848, '<td valign="top">Now thats the way to do things...with a sense of humor....love the choice...great clarity and like the black and white choice also....good job 8</td>', 'Now thats the way to do things...with a sense of humor....love the choice...great clarity and like the black and white choice also....good job 8', '2003-08-27 02:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
