(400948, 34994, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, you managed to avoid any flare. Nice use of negative space. Good dof. Technically well done, but not enough to draw my personal interest to lift this above an 8. Score: 8</td>', 'Nicely lit, you managed to avoid any flare. Nice use of negative space. Good dof. Technically well done, but not enough to draw my personal interest to lift this above an 8. Score: 8', '2003-08-27 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
