(401164, 34420, 11111, '<td valign="top">Is that the largest bottle cap or the smallest bottle opener I''ve ever seen! Would like to see the top left area in more focus, but very nice composition and focus overall. Original, too.</td>', 'Is that the largest bottle cap or the smallest bottle opener I''ve ever seen! Would like to see the top left area in more focus, but very nice composition and focus overall. Original, too.', '2003-08-27 11:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
