(401477, 34647, 11206, '<td valign="top">I really got to know what kind of spider is this.  I have the exact same spider at home.  Same web and everything.  Do you know?  I have to know.  Mine is even as big.  I just took a picture of it today.  Please respond back to me.  Thanks.  I like your picture.  (8)</td>', 'I really got to know what kind of spider is this.  I have the exact same spider at home.  Same web and everything.  Do you know?  I have to know.  Mine is even as big.  I just took a picture of it today.  Please respond back to me.  Thanks.  I like your picture.  (8)', '2003-08-27 14:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
