(402386, 34703, 10275, '<td valign="top">Could have been cropped with more space around it and a different composition. I gave you 8 for the clarity and colour, and the simplicity of this shot. Good capture.</td>', 'Could have been cropped with more space around it and a different composition. I gave you 8 for the clarity and colour, and the simplicity of this shot. Good capture.', '2003-08-28 05:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(402387, 34560, 10275, '<td valign="top">I am with you on this one. This is good creative shot.  Like the point of view. Could have been more on an angle to show more of the colour of the paint to spice it up. Good luck 9.</td>', 'I am with you on this one. This is good creative shot.  Like the point of view. Could have been more on an angle to show more of the colour of the paint to spice it up. Good luck 9.', '2003-08-28 05:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(402390, 34818, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very unique tool. You get extra points from me for this unusual image. It''s refreshing to look at after all the hammers and power tools. Great clarity and sharpness. Little bit of breething space around it would have been beneficial.  Well done. 9</td>', 'Very unique tool. You get extra points from me for this unusual image. It''s refreshing to look at after all the hammers and power tools. Great clarity and sharpness. Little bit of breething space around it would have been beneficial.  Well done. 9', '2003-08-28 05:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(402392, 34558, 10275, '<td valign="top">I really like that this shot is spontanious. The spalshing makes it even more powerful. That is SOME tool you have here. The background is tiny bit busy, but that is beyond your control. 8</td>', 'I really like that this shot is spontanious. The spalshing makes it even more powerful. That is SOME tool you have here. The background is tiny bit busy, but that is beyond your control. 8', '2003-08-28 05:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(402397, 35204, 10275, '<td valign="top">This photo tells a story. Extra points for refreshing humour... Horses are nice and sharp, but it''s a bit grainy in the dark blue area of the wheelbarow. Nothing that can''t be fixed with spot editing later on. I hope this does well. 8</td>', 'This photo tells a story. Extra points for refreshing humour... Horses are nice and sharp, but it''s a bit grainy in the dark blue area of the wheelbarow. Nothing that can''t be fixed with spot editing later on. I hope this does well. 8', '2003-08-28 05:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(402398, 35091, 10275, '<td valign="top">Cute. Great colour and sharpness. Very useful tool indeed (at least for those without driers...) 8</td>', 'Cute. Great colour and sharpness. Very useful tool indeed (at least for those without driers...) 8', '2003-08-28 05:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(402400, 34735, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Nice colour. It''s interesting that your tool doesn''t cast any shadow. It looks like it is floating in space - how did you achieve that? Maybe showing some surface that it sits on would have added to the composition, but I think you might have tried to simplify right? Well done. 8</td>', 'Good shot. Nice colour. It''s interesting that your tool doesn''t cast any shadow. It looks like it is floating in space - how did you achieve that? Maybe showing some surface that it sits on would have added to the composition, but I think you might have tried to simplify right? Well done. 8', '2003-08-28 05:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(402401, 34999, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot. The nib is perfect, but the handle is little bit messy. Like the simplicity very much. Great tool. 8</td>', 'Nice macro shot. The nib is perfect, but the handle is little bit messy. Like the simplicity very much. Great tool. 8', '2003-08-28 05:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(402404, 35088, 10700, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2003-08-28 05:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(402405, 34983, 10275, '<td valign="top">Extra points for humour. The snails are adorable, but are a bit dark and maybe there are too many?  The composition could have been different (simplified). Also some bounced light could have brought brightness into this photo. I still like it a lot. 8</td>', 'Extra points for humour. The snails are adorable, but are a bit dark and maybe there are too many?  The composition could have been different (simplified). Also some bounced light could have brought brightness into this photo. I still like it a lot. 8', '2003-08-28 05:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
