(402411, 35037, 10275, '<td valign="top">You may be one of the members here with older camera, so I don''t want to sound harsh. This image is very small and very blurry, so it''s very hard to look at. It seems interesting. The setup might have been nice, but I can''t really see it very well.</td>', 'You may be one of the members here with older camera, so I don''t want to sound harsh. This image is very small and very blurry, so it''s very hard to look at. It seems interesting. The setup might have been nice, but I can''t really see it very well.', '2003-08-28 05:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(402412, 35044, 10700, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2003-08-28 05:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(402413, 35078, 10275, '<td valign="top">Wow, talking about creative approach here. Cute shot. I am not going to vote you down, but others may not see it fitting this challenge much. But I appreciate people like you pushing the limits. Good candid shot (the right place at the right moment). I wouldn''t have chopped the animals off that much though. Fun to looke at.</td>', 'Wow, talking about creative approach here. Cute shot. I am not going to vote you down, but others may not see it fitting this challenge much. But I appreciate people like you pushing the limits. Good candid shot (the right place at the right moment). I wouldn''t have chopped the animals off that much though. Fun to looke at.', '2003-08-28 05:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(402418, 35064, 10700, '<td valign="top">mindblowing!@!!!</td>', 'mindblowing!@!!!', '2003-08-28 05:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(402419, 35130, 10275, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is an amazing bug shot. Well done macro. Does he have a hidden tool belt somewhere on his body? Or maybe he is holding a tiny hammer in his hand? Sorry, don''t mean to be sarcastic, but it amazes me that in all challenges there always are bug shots, no matter what the challenge topic is...</td>', 'Yes, this is an amazing bug shot. Well done macro. Does he have a hidden tool belt somewhere on his body? Or maybe he is holding a tiny hammer in his hand? Sorry, don''t mean to be sarcastic, but it amazes me that in all challenges there always are bug shots, no matter what the challenge topic is...', '2003-08-28 05:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(402422, 35190, 10700, '<td valign="top">the cutting edge!</td>', 'the cutting edge!', '2003-08-28 05:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(402423, 34988, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I bet you had fun taking it - and that''s more important than what I have to say, but IMO you could have emphasize the tool little bit more. The whole image takes attention away from the tool unfortunately. Also because it''s blurry - the sign in the front of the image takes my eyes away from the action which is the main point. Other than that, the colour is very good, so is the focus on the main point.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I bet you had fun taking it - and that''s more important than what I have to say, but IMO you could have emphasize the tool little bit more. The whole image takes attention away from the tool unfortunately. Also because it''s blurry - the sign in the front of the image takes my eyes away from the action which is the main point. Other than that, the colour is very good, so is the focus on the main point.', '2003-08-28 05:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(402424, 34926, 10275, '<td valign="top">Funny take. Point for humour, but your model is very pixelated and out of place in the dark. The image looks overworked a little. Also the composition is not pleasing in this case. The very blurry front distracts from the main subject - the tape.</td>', 'Funny take. Point for humour, but your model is very pixelated and out of place in the dark. The image looks overworked a little. Also the composition is not pleasing in this case. The very blurry front distracts from the main subject - the tape.', '2003-08-28 05:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(402425, 34590, 10700, '<td valign="top">good work my friend</td>', 'good work my friend', '2003-08-28 05:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(402426, 34549, 10700, '<td valign="top">sharp image</td>', 'sharp image', '2003-08-28 05:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(402427, 35077, 10275, '<td valign="top">Are we playing where is Waldo here? Is there a hidden tool in this image? IMO this doesn''t really fulfill the challenge. But it''s not bad image at all. The lamps are so bright though that it distracts a little. Great smoke capture.</td>', 'Are we playing where is Waldo here? Is there a hidden tool in this image? IMO this doesn''t really fulfill the challenge. But it''s not bad image at all. The lamps are so bright though that it distracts a little. Great smoke capture.', '2003-08-28 05:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(402429, 35245, 10700, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2003-08-28 05:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(402430, 34785, 10700, '<td valign="top">Red Alert !!!</td>', 'Red Alert !!!', '2003-08-28 05:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(402431, 35184, 10700, '<td valign="top">inspection of what?</td>', 'inspection of what?', '2003-08-28 05:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(402432, 35070, 10275, '<td valign="top">OK, I get the warm &amp; soft (the blanket) and the cold steel, but why is there a flower stuck in the image. It somehow doesn''t belong there. I have nothing against flower shots, but in this image it doesn''t do anything. The soft child''s hands holding the heavy steel tool is strong point enough. Also, I don''t know if it is due to your camera, but the image is pixelated and very hard to look at.</td>', 'OK, I get the warm & soft (the blanket) and the cold steel, but why is there a flower stuck in the image. It somehow doesn''t belong there. I have nothing against flower shots, but in this image it doesn''t do anything. The soft child''s hands holding the heavy steel tool is strong point enough. Also, I don''t know if it is due to your camera, but the image is pixelated and very hard to look at.', '2003-08-28 05:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(402433, 34790, 10700, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2003-08-28 05:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(402434, 35146, 10700, '<td valign="top">DR.DO LITTLE</td>', 'DR.DO LITTLE', '2003-08-28 05:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(402435, 34930, 10275, '<td valign="top">I do not consider lampshades to be tools, but OK, don''t want to be the neisayer either. The colour contrast is nice, but the whole image is out of focus and looks a bit overworked and grainy (but that might be due to the limitation of your camera). May I suggest tripod.</td>', 'I do not consider lampshades to be tools, but OK, don''t want to be the neisayer either. The colour contrast is nice, but the whole image is out of focus and looks a bit overworked and grainy (but that might be due to the limitation of your camera). May I suggest tripod.', '2003-08-28 05:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(402437, 35229, 10700, '<td valign="top">Amazingly perfect</td>', 'Amazingly perfect', '2003-08-28 05:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(402439, 35010, 10700, '<td valign="top">sharp attack</td>', 'sharp attack', '2003-08-28 05:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(402440, 34550, 10700, '<td valign="top">one of my top favourites</td>', 'one of my top favourites', '2003-08-28 06:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(402441, 35238, 10275, '<td valign="top">Creative take on tools. Points for the idea. The image itself is hard to look at - very busy and overdone. You have several things happening here - pink colour cast (unless you have pink dictionary), text out of focus and probably sharpening attempted, so it''s thrown out of wack. Also very close crop makes it even more busy.</td>', 'Creative take on tools. Points for the idea. The image itself is hard to look at - very busy and overdone. You have several things happening here - pink colour cast (unless you have pink dictionary), text out of focus and probably sharpening attempted, so it''s thrown out of wack. Also very close crop makes it even more busy.', '2003-08-28 06:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(402443, 34411, 10275, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''ve never thought of this as a tool, but fine. Interesting point of view (at least you picked clean toilet). The reflection in the water is a bit distracting. Be careful about oversharpening too.</td>', 'Ok, I''ve never thought of this as a tool, but fine. Interesting point of view (at least you picked clean toilet). The reflection in the water is a bit distracting. Be careful about oversharpening too.', '2003-08-28 06:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(402444, 34838, 10275, '<td valign="top">There is almost no detail in this image, which makes it not interesting to look at. If you had an interesting sky and a silluette, than that would be different sotry, but this one is kind of flat. The perspective isn''t bad.</td>', 'There is almost no detail in this image, which makes it not interesting to look at. If you had an interesting sky and a silluette, than that would be different sotry, but this one is kind of flat. The perspective isn''t bad.', '2003-08-28 06:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(402446, 35042, 10275, '<td valign="top">The tape almost disappears in this image lacking much needed contrast. It''s also very grainy and unsharp. Was the camera sitting on the floor? Maby turning on the lights would have helped? The end of tape was probably too close to the lens to get good focus. Or your DOF was shooting for further on the tape. The blurry front distracts from the rest of the image. The perspective and point of view are interesting.</td>', 'The tape almost disappears in this image lacking much needed contrast. It''s also very grainy and unsharp. Was the camera sitting on the floor? Maby turning on the lights would have helped? The end of tape was probably too close to the lens to get good focus. Or your DOF was shooting for further on the tape. The blurry front distracts from the rest of the image. The perspective and point of view are interesting.', '2003-08-28 06:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(402447, 35149, 10275, '<td valign="top">This composition doesn''t do much for me. It''s a bit messy. The image itself has good lighting, but it is out of focus and pixelated (might be lower end camera) or just sloppy focusing... Colour is fine.</td>', 'This composition doesn''t do much for me. It''s a bit messy. The image itself has good lighting, but it is out of focus and pixelated (might be lower end camera) or just sloppy focusing... Colour is fine.', '2003-08-28 06:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(402449, 34466, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour. You have classic mistake happening here - the focus of your camera is on the crab, not on the tool, which in this case should be the main subject. Be careful when locking your focus. Also on the right side it''s a bit too tightly cropped (maybe you were trying to cut out distracting elements?).</td>', 'Lovely colour. You have classic mistake happening here - the focus of your camera is on the crab, not on the tool, which in this case should be the main subject. Be careful when locking your focus. Also on the right side it''s a bit too tightly cropped (maybe you were trying to cut out distracting elements?).', '2003-08-28 06:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(402450, 35218, 10275, '<td valign="top">Tools of trade... This is great candid shot. Love the facial expressions of the two man facing me. Too bad it''s a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Tools of trade... This is great candid shot. Love the facial expressions of the two man facing me. Too bad it''s a bit out of focus.', '2003-08-28 06:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(402451, 34703, 10023, '<td valign="top">Excellent. 10</td>', 'Excellent. 10', '2003-08-28 06:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(402454, 34616, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept. I know this is hard to photograph, since your subject is darker than your background. Flash would have not been possible either due to the window glass. If you intented silluettes, than you should have overexposed it little further to boost the mountain and sky colours and make the cross and candles totally black. If silluette was not your intent, than underexposure for the shadows would have been better. I hope I am making sense.</td>', 'Very nice concept. I know this is hard to photograph, since your subject is darker than your background. Flash would have not been possible either due to the window glass. If you intented silluettes, than you should have overexposed it little further to boost the mountain and sky colours and make the cross and candles totally black. If silluette was not your intent, than underexposure for the shadows would have been better. I hope I am making sense.', '2003-08-28 06:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(402456, 35050, 10275, '<td valign="top">An image with less sparks would have been better choice here as it''s almost impossible to make out what am I actually looking at. The sparks are nice, but should not be the main focus of this shot.</td>', 'An image with less sparks would have been better choice here as it''s almost impossible to make out what am I actually looking at. The sparks are nice, but should not be the main focus of this shot.', '2003-08-28 06:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(402457, 35235, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is a superb shot of a car, but I do not consider cars to be tools. The reflections are really nice. Great contrast and clarity. Nice composition and crop. But this is IMO not a tool.</td>', 'This is a superb shot of a car, but I do not consider cars to be tools. The reflections are really nice. Great contrast and clarity. Nice composition and crop. But this is IMO not a tool.', '2003-08-28 06:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
