(402739, 35176, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  i like the closeup on the hands...if you would have had the full body shot i wouldn''t have liked it as much..i wish more people ( including myself) would take shots like this as opposed to full profile.  the smoke is great.  nice timing.</td>', 'cool shot.  i like the closeup on the hands...if you would have had the full body shot i wouldn''t have liked it as much..i wish more people ( including myself) would take shots like this as opposed to full profile.  the smoke is great.  nice timing.', '2003-08-28 13:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
