(402754, 35235, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool shot. the atmospheric element, the flag, the other vette, good composition and lighting.  the angle adds interest as well as the close up.  nice work.</td>', 'cool shot. the atmospheric element, the flag, the other vette, good composition and lighting.  the angle adds interest as well as the close up.  nice work.', '2003-08-28 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(402769, 34573, 4411, '<td valign="top">I love the ''clean room'' effect on this, looking forward to seeing how this was done (softbox?). The lack of shadows is very striking. Great stuff, well done.</td>', 'I love the ''clean room'' effect on this, looking forward to seeing how this was done (softbox?). The lack of shadows is very striking. Great stuff, well done.', '2003-08-28 13:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(402770, 35037, 2567, '<td valign="top">It looks unfocused to me.  Composition not bad but the photo is to small to see details.</td>', 'It looks unfocused to me.  Composition not bad but the photo is to small to see details.', '2003-08-28 13:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(402782, 34649, 5792, '<td valign="top">I like this type of shot where the main subject is surrounded by similar objects. I wonder how this would look under the ROT. Lime green hue is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like this type of shot where the main subject is surrounded by similar objects. I wonder how this would look under the ROT. Lime green hue is a nice touch.', '2003-08-28 14:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(402784, 35242, 5792, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed, but a nice idea, good composition.</td>', 'Overprocessed, but a nice idea, good composition.', '2003-08-28 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(402789, 35227, 9893, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I just wish there wasn''t so much negative space.</td>', 'Great idea, I just wish there wasn''t so much negative space.', '2003-08-28 14:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(402790, 35171, 5792, '<td valign="top">Would be better if the image had more brightness and contrast. Very well composed. I''ve been dinged on borders like yours and you might to with this one. Image makes you feel like you are in a recording studio when they are taking a break.</td>', 'Would be better if the image had more brightness and contrast. Very well composed. I''ve been dinged on borders like yours and you might to with this one. Image makes you feel like you are in a recording studio when they are taking a break.', '2003-08-28 14:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(402795, 34994, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very well composed by using the corner to corner angle. White background is perfect for the yellow tape. A very well done image.</td>', 'Very well composed by using the corner to corner angle. White background is perfect for the yellow tape. A very well done image.', '2003-08-28 14:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(402799, 34622, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and done nicely.</td>', 'Interesting concept and done nicely.', '2003-08-28 14:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(402814, 35035, 9977, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!</td>', 'Very nice shot!', '2003-08-28 14:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(402816, 35236, 9977, '<td valign="top">Very good shot and composition...</td>', 'Very good shot and composition...', '2003-08-28 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(402818, 34816, 5792, '<td valign="top">The concept of having a set of tools in miscellaneous positions is a good one. I like that. However IMHO implementaion could have been better. You can put my thoughts in the "for whatever it is worth" department; I mean no disrespect.<br/>Number one, this needs more brightness and contrast. That would make the tools stand out out better and the background jet black. Two, for me it does not work that the foreground object is so large and close yet it is out of focus. It begs to be the main subject, but it is not.  A different arrangement would be better. Lastly, with a dark background it is important that colors stand out. Yellow and red are both fantastic colors for a black background. In this image the color should be adjusted more to bring that out.</td>', 'The concept of having a set of tools in miscellaneous positions is a good one. I like that. However IMHO implementaion could have been better. You can put my thoughts in the "for whatever it is worth" department; I mean no disrespect.Number one, this needs more brightness and contrast. That would make the tools stand out out better and the background jet black. Two, for me it does not work that the foreground object is so large and close yet it is out of focus. It begs to be the main subject, but it is not.  A different arrangement would be better. Lastly, with a dark background it is important that colors stand out. Yellow and red are both fantastic colors for a black background. In this image the color should be adjusted more to bring that out.', '2003-08-28 14:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(402824, 34547, 5792, '<td valign="top">This one is sick, of course, but exceptionally well done and should be scored high. I hope people don''t give it low scores for content, but I''m sure some will. It is very well composed and the while mottled background makes the rest of the image stand out. Very clean image; well, except for the blood. :)</td>', 'This one is sick, of course, but exceptionally well done and should be scored high. I hope people don''t give it low scores for content, but I''m sure some will. It is very well composed and the while mottled background makes the rest of the image stand out. Very clean image; well, except for the blood. :)', '2003-08-28 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(402829, 34573, 9643, '<td valign="top">What a striking image!  The care taken in the arrangement pushes this rating up considerably.</td>', 'What a striking image!  The care taken in the arrangement pushes this rating up considerably.', '2003-08-28 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(402831, 35160, 5792, '<td valign="top">I can never decide if I like an image like this with the front in focus or the back like this one. I this case though I think I would have liked it better if the front were focused and placed lower and toward the lower right corner to make the shadow on the left stand out better. Shadowing is really what would make this image outstanding. You might have had to give it a slightly wider angel to show the whole shadow.</td>', 'I can never decide if I like an image like this with the front in focus or the back like this one. I this case though I think I would have liked it better if the front were focused and placed lower and toward the lower right corner to make the shadow on the left stand out better. Shadowing is really what would make this image outstanding. You might have had to give it a slightly wider angel to show the whole shadow.', '2003-08-28 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(402832, 35013, 9643, '<td valign="top">The angle of this shot very much enhances the appreciation for the handiwork that went into the making of this relic.</td>', 'The angle of this shot very much enhances the appreciation for the handiwork that went into the making of this relic.', '2003-08-28 14:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(402837, 35170, 11073, '<td valign="top">great shot! I really like this picture. good use of light and composition. dof is nice too.</td>', 'great shot! I really like this picture. good use of light and composition. dof is nice too.', '2003-08-28 14:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(402838, 35004, 9643, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of the level on the wood and the angle of your shot.  I''m not certain that I like the bw because the bubble in the level doesn''t stand out as well.  Also the background is busy and distracting for me.</td>', 'I really like the angle of the level on the wood and the angle of your shot.  I''m not certain that I like the bw because the bubble in the level doesn''t stand out as well.  Also the background is busy and distracting for me.', '2003-08-28 14:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(402839, 35155, 11073, '<td valign="top">nice.  the negative effect lends interest to an otherwise not very interesting subject.</td>', 'nice.  the negative effect lends interest to an otherwise not very interesting subject.', '2003-08-28 14:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
