(402886, 35004, 11073, '<td valign="top">i think with the busy background that this would have worked better in color...but that''s just my opinion...and one that i''m not using in my basis for the score.  The angles are good - i like that there are horizontal as well as vertical lines ( i''m guessing you tried that =`)  the lighting is good as well.  nice work.</td>', 'i think with the busy background that this would have worked better in color...but that''s just my opinion...and one that i''m not using in my basis for the score.  The angles are good - i like that there are horizontal as well as vertical lines ( i''m guessing you tried that =`)  the lighting is good as well.  nice work.', '2003-08-28 15:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(402887, 35200, 4008, '<td valign="top">not sure what I am looking at exactly, but I like the warm color, the structure and abstract result of the total 7</td>', 'not sure what I am looking at exactly, but I like the warm color, the structure and abstract result of the total 7', '2003-08-28 15:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
