(403056, 35080, 11073, '<td valign="top">i think that i would have liked to see a different angle to add more interest...possible from a side or from the bottom.  as it is the background is too much imo and looks too much like a snapshot.  i like the "junk" in the foreground and would like a tighter shot on the forefront as a whole. its a good idea but i think you need to be closer next time to "bring the viewer" into the pic more and add interest.</td>', 'i think that i would have liked to see a different angle to add more interest...possible from a side or from the bottom.  as it is the background is too much imo and looks too much like a snapshot.  i like the "junk" in the foreground and would like a tighter shot on the forefront as a whole. its a good idea but i think you need to be closer next time to "bring the viewer" into the pic more and add interest.', '2003-08-28 16:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(403057, 34427, 3569, '<td valign="top">focus a bit off.</td>', 'focus a bit off.', '2003-08-28 16:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(403058, 35078, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a pair of Cheetas, but I see no tools, not even a claw or tooth.  I guess the tongue could be your tool, but.....</td>', 'Great shot of a pair of Cheetas, but I see no tools, not even a claw or tooth.  I guess the tongue could be your tool, but.....', '2003-08-28 16:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(403060, 35228, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2003-08-28 17:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(403061, 35102, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great eye direction to subject...</td>', 'Great eye direction to subject...', '2003-08-28 17:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(403062, 35031, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great shot... the light under the door is somewhat distracting though.</td>', 'Great shot... the light under the door is somewhat distracting though.', '2003-08-28 17:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(403063, 34983, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of snails...  Crisp &amp; sharp.  Good job..</td>', 'Interesting use of snails...  Crisp & sharp.  Good job..', '2003-08-28 17:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(403064, 35147, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit to dark for my eyes.</td>', 'A bit to dark for my eyes.', '2003-08-28 17:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(403065, 34951, 3569, '<td valign="top">To make a greater shor, try cropping it closer to the subject and get rid of the messy background.</td>', 'To make a greater shor, try cropping it closer to the subject and get rid of the messy background.', '2003-08-28 17:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(403066, 35159, 3569, '<td valign="top">Is that how they work.. Nice shot too.</td>', 'Is that how they work.. Nice shot too.', '2003-08-28 17:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(403067, 35087, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot...</td>', 'Interesting shot...', '2003-08-28 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(403068, 35242, 3569, '<td valign="top">The grain is doing you no good.</td>', 'The grain is doing you no good.', '2003-08-28 17:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(403069, 35122, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The light is a bit disturbing and draws your eye to it.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The light is a bit disturbing and draws your eye to it.', '2003-08-28 17:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(403070, 35130, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nature''s tool.  Next time try a stick instead of a finger, looks more natural.</td>', 'Nature''s tool.  Next time try a stick instead of a finger, looks more natural.', '2003-08-28 17:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(403071, 35176, 5792, '<td valign="top">Simply put,  this is the best image in this challenge</td>', 'Simply put,  this is the best image in this challenge', '2003-08-28 17:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(403072, 35077, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice use of thirds.</td>', 'Nice use of thirds.', '2003-08-28 17:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(403073, 35244, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture. The motion capture coupled with the sharpness of the hit sets this image head and shoulders above the others.</td>', 'This is a great capture. The motion capture coupled with the sharpness of the hit sets this image head and shoulders above the others.', '2003-08-28 17:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(403075, 35153, 11052, '<td valign="top">Good reflections u got there ! Gut !</td>', 'Good reflections u got there ! Gut !', '2003-08-28 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(403076, 34774, 11487, '<td valign="top">Cool motion shot.  Would have liked to see hand also.</td>', 'Cool motion shot.  Would have liked to see hand also.', '2003-08-28 17:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(403077, 35097, 3569, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my father the commercial artist.  I like it...</td>', 'Reminds me of my father the commercial artist.  I like it...', '2003-08-28 17:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(403078, 35001, 11487, '<td valign="top">Like the color.  What''s the purpose of the gloves?</td>', 'Like the color.  What''s the purpose of the gloves?', '2003-08-28 17:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(403079, 35247, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a humorous, but it is the exceptional clarity and composition that makes this a great image.</td>', 'This is a humorous, but it is the exceptional clarity and composition that makes this a great image.', '2003-08-28 17:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(403080, 34876, 3569, '<td valign="top">Definately big...</td>', 'Definately big...', '2003-08-28 17:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(403081, 34588, 5792, '<td valign="top">Best of the "sparks" images in this challenge. This is an exceptionally well conceived and composed image. Color and clarity are outstanding.</td>', 'Best of the "sparks" images in this challenge. This is an exceptionally well conceived and composed image. Color and clarity are outstanding.', '2003-08-28 17:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(403083, 34969, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts.</td>', 'Great contrasts.', '2003-08-28 17:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(403084, 34735, 11487, '<td valign="top">nice shot for advertising.  maybe some wood shavings as a prop would have worked.</td>', 'nice shot for advertising.  maybe some wood shavings as a prop would have worked.', '2003-08-28 17:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(403087, 34420, 2223, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, how cute. 8</td>', 'Awwwww, how cute. 8', '2003-08-28 17:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(403088, 34735, 4008, '<td valign="top">strong light but no shadows ? I will be interested to see how you did this and read your comments after the challenge.</td>', 'strong light but no shadows ? I will be interested to see how you did this and read your comments after the challenge.', '2003-08-28 17:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(403090, 35176, 11487, '<td valign="top">great picture</td>', 'great picture', '2003-08-28 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(403091, 34558, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast and ya got a winner.</td>', 'A bit more contrast and ya got a winner.', '2003-08-28 17:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(403092, 34771, 11487, '<td valign="top">interesting shot</td>', 'interesting shot', '2003-08-28 17:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(403093, 34853, 2223, '<td valign="top">I like how the first words that pop out are "whoops. Sorry." 8</td>', 'I like how the first words that pop out are "whoops. Sorry." 8', '2003-08-28 17:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(403094, 35119, 2223, '<td valign="top">I love your little studio, i''m  also very jealous.</td>', 'I love your little studio, i''m  also very jealous.', '2003-08-28 17:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(403095, 34926, 6458, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, not a wonderful image tho. A bit more light on the guy would have helped.</td>', 'Cute idea, not a wonderful image tho. A bit more light on the guy would have helped.', '2003-08-28 17:32:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(403097, 34973, 6458, '<td valign="top">Where''d all the detail go? It looks like this image is suffering from too much NeatImage. I like the composition but it''s not a really exciting image to me.</td>', 'Where''d all the detail go? It looks like this image is suffering from too much NeatImage. I like the composition but it''s not a really exciting image to me.', '2003-08-28 17:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(403098, 34711, 2223, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this on a solid colored background, i think the design would be more profound.</td>', 'I would like to see this on a solid colored background, i think the design would be more profound.', '2003-08-28 17:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(403100, 34906, 6458, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, details and colours. Well done! One of the better I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Nice composition, details and colours. Well done! One of the better I''ve seen so far.', '2003-08-28 17:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(403102, 34547, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hah hah.. Good one. Bonus points for the Pink Floyd reference. Not entirely fond of the border, but I''m not that fussed about it either.</td>', 'Hah hah.. Good one. Bonus points for the Pink Floyd reference. Not entirely fond of the border, but I''m not that fussed about it either.', '2003-08-28 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(403108, 35235, 6458, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, and I have a weakness for the 64-67 vettes. Not too sure about the background clutter, but I know there''s nothing you can do about it. Well done!</td>', 'Lovely shot, and I have a weakness for the 64-67 vettes. Not too sure about the background clutter, but I know there''s nothing you can do about it. Well done!', '2003-08-28 17:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(403110, 35077, 5792, '<td valign="top">This surrealistic image captures the feeling of an environmental holocaust we all fear from industrialization. One terrific capture.</td>', 'This surrealistic image captures the feeling of an environmental holocaust we all fear from industrialization. One terrific capture.', '2003-08-28 17:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(403112, 35017, 6458, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt, but the flash has caused harsh lighting and the rolling pin looks slightly out of focus. Composition is okay, but a little boring. Better luck next time!</td>', 'Nice attempt, but the flash has caused harsh lighting and the rolling pin looks slightly out of focus. Composition is okay, but a little boring. Better luck next time!', '2003-08-28 17:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(403114, 34703, 5792, '<td valign="top">Some images stand above the others to become top finishers because of their quality. This is one of them.</td>', 'Some images stand above the others to become top finishers because of their quality. This is one of them.', '2003-08-28 17:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(403115, 35019, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hammers, hammers everywhere. Good shot, I like the way you used the DOF to select the appropriate hammer.</td>', 'Hammers, hammers everywhere. Good shot, I like the way you used the DOF to select the appropriate hammer.', '2003-08-28 17:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(403116, 35037, 8736, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it seems blurry.  You could also make it larger.  Use all the space that you can!</td>', 'Good idea, but it seems blurry.  You could also make it larger.  Use all the space that you can!', '2003-08-28 17:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(403117, 35243, 6458, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting and visible background don''t do well for this pic. The crop looks a little too tight on the left of the pliers.</td>', 'Harsh lighting and visible background don''t do well for this pic. The crop looks a little too tight on the left of the pliers.', '2003-08-28 17:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(403118, 35079, 8736, '<td valign="top">Seems like all the colors blend together and it''s hard to make out one tool without studying.  Good idea though!</td>', 'Seems like all the colors blend together and it''s hard to make out one tool without studying.  Good idea though!', '2003-08-28 17:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(403119, 35075, 8736, '<td valign="top">Hope you had the safety glasses on =) I like that you have it in motion.</td>', 'Hope you had the safety glasses on =) I like that you have it in motion.', '2003-08-28 17:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(403120, 35078, 8736, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, thinking "outside the box".</td>', 'Cute picture, thinking "outside the box".', '2003-08-28 17:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(403121, 34822, 8736, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to seen these arranged some other way.  And with better lighting.  Seems too dark.</td>', 'I would have liked to seen these arranged some other way.  And with better lighting.  Seems too dark.', '2003-08-28 17:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(403122, 35019, 5792, '<td valign="top">When you combine high photographic quality, nice shadowing, content, lighting, background and appropriateness to the challenge you come up with a top image like this one. This is one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'When you combine high photographic quality, nice shadowing, content, lighting, background and appropriateness to the challenge you come up with a top image like this one. This is one of the best in this challenge.', '2003-08-28 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(403123, 35074, 6458, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. It seems like this shot is more about his hands than the clippers. The exposure is great and I love the contrasts.</td>', 'Wonderful. It seems like this shot is more about his hands than the clippers. The exposure is great and I love the contrasts.', '2003-08-28 17:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(403124, 34853, 8736, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  Seems like it could maybe be lightened up a bit though.</td>', 'I like this picture.  Seems like it could maybe be lightened up a bit though.', '2003-08-28 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(403125, 35010, 8736, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what it is....</td>', 'Can''t tell what it is....', '2003-08-28 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(403127, 34830, 8736, '<td valign="top">That would feel good right now.  With the candles in the background, I tend to go there first.  When the subject isn''t the candles.</td>', 'That would feel good right now.  With the candles in the background, I tend to go there first.  When the subject isn''t the candles.', '2003-08-28 17:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(403128, 34649, 8736, '<td valign="top">I like the colors used in this one.  And the fact that you only focused in on a couple of them.</td>', 'I like the colors used in this one.  And the fact that you only focused in on a couple of them.', '2003-08-28 17:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(403130, 34969, 8736, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this picture.  You have rows of tools going up the wall.  Great job!</td>', 'I like the composition of this picture.  You have rows of tools going up the wall.  Great job!', '2003-08-28 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(403131, 35135, 8736, '<td valign="top">I like the movement that is felt in this picture.  You can just imagine the sparks flying.</td>', 'I like the movement that is felt in this picture.  You can just imagine the sparks flying.', '2003-08-28 17:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(403132, 35111, 8736, '<td valign="top">I like just the little slits of light that are shining on the saw.  Good job!</td>', 'I like just the little slits of light that are shining on the saw.  Good job!', '2003-08-28 17:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(403133, 35214, 8736, '<td valign="top">I love fishing!  I think I would have liked this picture better if the background was a lighter color.</td>', 'I love fishing!  I think I would have liked this picture better if the background was a lighter color.', '2003-08-28 17:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(403134, 34531, 8736, '<td valign="top">Looks a little pixelated.  Like the idea though.</td>', 'Looks a little pixelated.  Like the idea though.', '2003-08-28 17:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(403135, 35087, 10785, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!! I want to give it a 1 so badly just to sock it to the old regime...but I will give it a 10 despite my ideological differences!</td>', 'Awesome!!! I want to give it a 1 so badly just to sock it to the old regime...but I will give it a 10 despite my ideological differences!', '2003-08-28 18:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(403141, 34908, 9437, '<td valign="top">Good balance of space. The textured surface is a good juxtaposition to the smoothness of the steel. This goes beyond the 5 gray zones concept.</td>', 'Good balance of space. The textured surface is a good juxtaposition to the smoothness of the steel. This goes beyond the 5 gray zones concept.', '2003-08-28 18:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(403144, 35072, 9437, '<td valign="top">clever way to add the illusion of 3rd dimension; however, the spot on the cloth and the background to the upper left is a distraction. Also I''d like to see a tad less softness in the foreground.</td>', 'clever way to add the illusion of 3rd dimension; however, the spot on the cloth and the background to the upper left is a distraction. Also I''d like to see a tad less softness in the foreground.', '2003-08-28 18:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(403145, 35200, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract look of the picture. I had to study it to get the connection with tools. I like that -- a real thinker.</td>', 'I like the abstract look of the picture. I had to study it to get the connection with tools. I like that -- a real thinker.', '2003-08-28 18:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(403147, 34550, 9437, '<td valign="top">Wow this was a stretch! But quite imaginative. I''m mad for detail, perspective and  focus. You aced it.</td>', 'Wow this was a stretch! But quite imaginative. I''m mad for detail, perspective and  focus. You aced it.', '2003-08-28 18:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(403148, 35121, 4411, '<td valign="top">I love the sheeting you''ve used as a background here! Great idea.<br/>The shot is good, though the old look of the abacus does clash somewhat with the modern look of the backdrop.</td>', 'I love the sheeting you''ve used as a background here! Great idea.The shot is good, though the old look of the abacus does clash somewhat with the modern look of the backdrop.', '2003-08-28 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(403156, 35169, 9437, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to have seen more focus or a crop at about the 6 inch mark on the ruler.</td>', 'Would have liked to have seen more focus or a crop at about the 6 inch mark on the ruler.', '2003-08-28 18:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(403164, 34969, 9437, '<td valign="top">Like the inter weaving angles in this photo. It tells a story. I would like to see more of a cold tone to accentuate the metal.</td>', 'Like the inter weaving angles in this photo. It tells a story. I would like to see more of a cold tone to accentuate the metal.', '2003-08-28 18:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(403167, 34982, 9437, '<td valign="top">The more I looked at this the more it grew on me. I think having the axe head on the ground is what gives the photo movement. The blonde wood of the handle really does a good job of drawing the eye downward.</td>', 'The more I looked at this the more it grew on me. I think having the axe head on the ground is what gives the photo movement. The blonde wood of the handle really does a good job of drawing the eye downward.', '2003-08-28 18:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(403168, 35091, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the play of color in this photo. It evokes to my eye some work I''ve seen in National Geographic of fishing dinghy''s on the shores of the Mediterrainian. Good job</td>', 'I like the play of color in this photo. It evokes to my eye some work I''ve seen in National Geographic of fishing dinghy''s on the shores of the Mediterrainian. Good job', '2003-08-28 18:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(403171, 35094, 3469, '<td valign="top">I see what you are trying to show, for me it just doesn''t work. The picture is too dark to show sufficient contrast between the handle and the screw. And even if the picture follows the rule of thirds, that does not mean that a full black 2/3 is interesting.</td>', 'I see what you are trying to show, for me it just doesn''t work. The picture is too dark to show sufficient contrast between the handle and the screw. And even if the picture follows the rule of thirds, that does not mean that a full black 2/3 is interesting.', '2003-08-28 18:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(403172, 34818, 9437, '<td valign="top">Who knew they had such things? Imaginative use of the theme. Great focus. Cute portrait.</td>', 'Who knew they had such things? Imaginative use of the theme. Great focus. Cute portrait.', '2003-08-28 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(403173, 34922, 9437, '<td valign="top">Good use of color and storytelling. Love the detail</td>', 'Good use of color and storytelling. Love the detail', '2003-08-28 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(403174, 35154, 9437, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the composition, but what detail! Would love to know what camera took this.</td>', 'Don''t care for the composition, but what detail! Would love to know what camera took this.', '2003-08-28 18:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(403175, 35171, 9437, '<td valign="top">The mixing board really speaks to me. The sticks are a distraction.</td>', 'The mixing board really speaks to me. The sticks are a distraction.', '2003-08-28 18:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(403176, 35138, 3469, '<td valign="top">Somehow I get the feeling that I am being had: the tools are ''hovering'' in the picture, as if edited in from another picture where the Porsche engine was not present. The specific tools are not likely to be used on this engine in its present condition anyway.</td>', 'Somehow I get the feeling that I am being had: the tools are ''hovering'' in the picture, as if edited in from another picture where the Porsche engine was not present. The specific tools are not likely to be used on this engine in its present condition anyway.', '2003-08-28 18:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(403177, 35244, 9437, '<td valign="top">clever use of movement and color saves what would otherwise be an ordinary photo.</td>', 'clever use of movement and color saves what would otherwise be an ordinary photo.', '2003-08-28 18:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(403179, 34779, 9437, '<td valign="top">If Picasso had a grandpa.....</td>', 'If Picasso had a grandpa.....', '2003-08-28 18:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(403180, 34441, 9437, '<td valign="top">The light in the foreground detracts from the silhouette. When I covered it with my hand the picture became an 8</td>', 'The light in the foreground detracts from the silhouette. When I covered it with my hand the picture became an 8', '2003-08-28 18:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(403181, 35072, 3469, '<td valign="top">out of focus/ the focus is not at an interesting point. There is a distracting spot at 1/3 and there is something undefined in the corner that does not play a role of any importance. Where is the wine bottlle to make the picture interesting?</td>', 'out of focus/ the focus is not at an interesting point. There is a distracting spot at 1/3 and there is something undefined in the corner that does not play a role of any importance. Where is the wine bottlle to make the picture interesting?', '2003-08-28 18:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(403183, 35001, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting.  However, I\''m not entirely clear on what the tool is.  None the less, the quality of this photo is good enough to put it in the top 10 or 20.</td>', 'Excellent lighting.  However, I\''m not entirely clear on what the tool is.  None the less, the quality of this photo is good enough to put it in the top 10 or 20.', '2003-08-28 18:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(403186, 35218, 7291, '<td valign="top">Is that a fight happening?</td>', 'Is that a fight happening?', '2003-08-28 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(403187, 34703, 9437, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color and motion.</td>', 'Excellent use of color and motion.', '2003-08-28 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(403190, 35175, 9437, '<td valign="top">The silver disk in the foreground right is a distraction.</td>', 'The silver disk in the foreground right is a distraction.', '2003-08-28 18:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(403193, 34578, 9437, '<td valign="top">Love the color. Had to think about this for a minute. The steep angle between the handle and the fork gives it a 3D quality. Good job.</td>', 'Love the color. Had to think about this for a minute. The steep angle between the handle and the fork gives it a 3D quality. Good job.', '2003-08-28 18:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(403198, 34906, 9437, '<td valign="top">Outstanding use of color and focus. I love seeing the dust. Good job.</td>', 'Outstanding use of color and focus. I love seeing the dust. Good job.', '2003-08-28 19:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(403200, 35127, 9437, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the title, but you''ve got color, composition and clarity down. Oh wait that''s for diamonds.... (yes, I know that''s color, cut and clarity)<br/>Seriously, I like the detail and balance of cool to warm tones and the lack of pixelation on your diagonal lines.</td>', 'Don''t care for the title, but you''ve got color, composition and clarity down. Oh wait that''s for diamonds.... (yes, I know that''s color, cut and clarity)Seriously, I like the detail and balance of cool to warm tones and the lack of pixelation on your diagonal lines.', '2003-08-28 19:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(403201, 34470, 9437, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is either, but I like the abstractness of the photo.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is either, but I like the abstractness of the photo.', '2003-08-28 19:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(403204, 34588, 7291, '<td valign="top">OOHHH...FIRE!  Always a winning element here on DPC.</td>', 'OOHHH...FIRE!  Always a winning element here on DPC.', '2003-08-28 19:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(403208, 35126, 7291, '<td valign="top">mmmmmmm.........Piiiizzaaaaa...*drools on keyboard*</td>', 'mmmmmmm.........Piiiizzaaaaa...*drools on keyboard*', '2003-08-28 19:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
