(403563, 35228, 4008, '<td valign="top">In my view this is a mix between a product shot (in which case there are too many distracting reflections) and a bar atmosphere shot (in which case there is not sufficient of the bar to be seen). Good setup though with the light behind the shaker, attractive color and object. 7</td>', 'In my view this is a mix between a product shot (in which case there are too many distracting reflections) and a bar atmosphere shot (in which case there is not sufficient of the bar to be seen). Good setup though with the light behind the shaker, attractive color and object. 7', '2003-08-29 07:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(403564, 34711, 6678, '<td valign="top">Now that is clever.... Unless I have completely made up my interpretation, in which case I have been looking at pictures for tooo long.</td>', 'Now that is clever.... Unless I have completely made up my interpretation, in which case I have been looking at pictures for tooo long.', '2003-08-29 07:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(403565, 35237, 4008, '<td valign="top">took some time to recognise it, those are flutes or organ pipes or something like it ? musical instruments at least.  would have liked to see some more warm colors of the wood. Composition is special/abstract but not very appealing.</td>', 'took some time to recognise it, those are flutes or organ pipes or something like it ? musical instruments at least.  would have liked to see some more warm colors of the wood. Composition is special/abstract but not very appealing.', '2003-08-29 07:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(403566, 34809, 4008, '<td valign="top">you need to spend some more thought on composition. The plastic bag is totally unneeded, the leather glove and safety (?) glasses are there but not in such a way that they add to the picture. The light is flat, all in all not very attractive. 4</td>', 'you need to spend some more thought on composition. The plastic bag is totally unneeded, the leather glove and safety (?) glasses are there but not in such a way that they add to the picture. The light is flat, all in all not very attractive. 4', '2003-08-29 07:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(403568, 35097, 4008, '<td valign="top">very good, a hand drawing a hand. A slightly more simple composition (some less pencils, remove the pad from underneath the hand), would have further strengthened the image in my opinion. 7</td>', 'very good, a hand drawing a hand. A slightly more simple composition (some less pencils, remove the pad from underneath the hand), would have further strengthened the image in my opinion. 7', '2003-08-29 07:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(403569, 34703, 4008, '<td valign="top">strange water effect, original choice of tool, good sharpness and color. ......Looking again at my comment, I realise it is a bit short and unclear. What I mean with strange water effect is that it looks strange with a large amount of water underneath the toothbrush and hardly anything above. I first thought the image was upside down. But again, you captured it with great clarity and color and it was a refreshing choice of tool. Congrats on the ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-03 08:59:23.</i></td>', 'strange water effect, original choice of tool, good sharpness and color. ......Looking again at my comment, I realise it is a bit short and unclear. What I mean with strange water effect is that it looks strange with a large amount of water underneath the toothbrush and hardly anything above. I first thought the image was upside down. But again, you captured it with great clarity and color and it was a refreshing choice of tool. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2003-08-29 07:49:20.000000', '2003-09-03 09:59:23.000000', 1),
