(404507, 34573, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness, like the simple colour of this image. Interesting setup. It''s almost like a catalog shot. The lighting is excellent as there are almost no shadows cast beside the tools. What surface is it on? Well done 10.</td>', 'Good sharpness, like the simple colour of this image. Interesting setup. It''s almost like a catalog shot. The lighting is excellent as there are almost no shadows cast beside the tools. What surface is it on? Well done 10.', '2003-08-30 04:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(404508, 34994, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and very sharp clarity. Like the crop in the upper corner, but the lower corner would have benefited from more space around the end of the tape. This is great overall shot. Simple and clean. 10</td>', 'Good lighting and very sharp clarity. Like the crop in the upper corner, but the lower corner would have benefited from more space around the end of the tape. This is great overall shot. Simple and clean. 10', '2003-08-30 04:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(404512, 35240, 11073, '<td valign="top">:) good interpretation...and good for you for still smoking!  I don''t but I can''t stand the hypocrisy (sp?) behind all this anti tobacco crap thats going on!  Smoke em if you got em I say.  But back to the photo...I like the composition and the lighting.  The color is great.  Good texture also.</td>', ':) good interpretation...and good for you for still smoking!  I don''t but I can''t stand the hypocrisy (sp?) behind all this anti tobacco crap thats going on!  Smoke em if you got em I say.  But back to the photo...I like the composition and the lighting.  The color is great.  Good texture also.', '2003-08-30 05:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(404513, 34983, 11073, '<td valign="top">=`) that''s great.  I love the originality.  good composition, it was a little dark for my tastes, but that''s a very minor observation and in no way a complaint.  cool shot.</td>', '=`) that''s great.  I love the originality.  good composition, it was a little dark for my tastes, but that''s a very minor observation and in no way a complaint.  cool shot.', '2003-08-30 05:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(404516, 35239, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. My #1 pick for the tools challenge.</td>', 'I really love this shot. My #1 pick for the tools challenge.', '2003-08-30 06:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(404518, 35175, 3554, '<td valign="top">Would be better without the object in the bottom right corner. Not bad subjects but kind of lifeless in this shot.</td>', 'Would be better without the object in the bottom right corner. Not bad subjects but kind of lifeless in this shot.', '2003-08-30 06:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
