(404541, 35208, 11321, '<td valign="top">If you want to sell the tool, then the picture is good for potential buyers. Try to change the shooting angle.</td>', 'If you want to sell the tool, then the picture is good for potential buyers. Try to change the shooting angle.', '2003-08-30 07:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
