(404990, 35164, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field effect, almost looks edited (the way it is blurred).  Color is unique, composition works.  Super job!</td>', 'Great depth of field effect, almost looks edited (the way it is blurred).  Color is unique, composition works.  Super job!', '2003-08-31 00:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
