(405001, 35227, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is great. I wish the lighting was not so extreme. The tool is dark so it blends in too well with the plant. If the light was dimmer and you were able to bring out the contrast of the plant I think you would have a really nice image.<br/> <br/>This is such a nice image. Great idea. Love the dirt lying on the flat surface.</td>', 'Composition is great. I wish the lighting was not so extreme. The tool is dark so it blends in too well with the plant. If the light was dimmer and you were able to bring out the contrast of the plant I think you would have a really nice image. This is such a nice image. Great idea. Love the dirt lying on the flat surface.', '2003-08-31 01:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(405026, 35160, 4767, '<td valign="top">I like selective focus MOST times, but would have liked this better if the  ''business end'' of the corkscrew were in focus.</td>', 'I like selective focus MOST times, but would have liked this better if the  ''business end'' of the corkscrew were in focus.', '2003-08-31 03:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(405027, 34735, 4767, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot, a great mental image of the heritage of the plane.  I''d like to see it in a less sterile environment, perhaps with something that would indicate the on-going usefulness of the tool.  (Perhaps wood shavings???  Whatever spoke to you as an artist).</td>', 'A wonderful shot, a great mental image of the heritage of the plane.  I''d like to see it in a less sterile environment, perhaps with something that would indicate the on-going usefulness of the tool.  (Perhaps wood shavings???  Whatever spoke to you as an artist).', '2003-08-31 03:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(405028, 34998, 4767, '<td valign="top">NICE tools!  Worthy of a craftsman, I''m sure!</td>', 'NICE tools!  Worthy of a craftsman, I''m sure!', '2003-08-31 03:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
