(405116, 35160, 8779, '<td valign="top">Great subject and interesting choice of angles. Love the shadows too.<br/> <br/>But personally, the most interesting part of the corkscrew is the actual spiral, and at this angle, I feel that, throwing the tip of the corkscrew [most interesting point] out of focus has lowered the interest level down a few bars. Perhaps from a difference angle to have a better overview of the contraption? =)</td>', 'Great subject and interesting choice of angles. Love the shadows too. But personally, the most interesting part of the corkscrew is the actual spiral, and at this angle, I feel that, throwing the tip of the corkscrew [most interesting point] out of focus has lowered the interest level down a few bars. Perhaps from a difference angle to have a better overview of the contraption? =)', '2003-08-31 11:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(405117, 34948, 8779, '<td valign="top">lol. V. interesting idea!<br/> <br/>But the actual quality of the picture is a bit of a let down... There is way too much noise and it''s got a blue-ish tinge... Also, the extra space above and below the "TOOLS!" could have been cropped off to centralise the bits =)</td>', 'lol. V. interesting idea! But the actual quality of the picture is a bit of a let down... There is way too much noise and it''s got a blue-ish tinge... Also, the extra space above and below the "TOOLS!" could have been cropped off to centralise the bits =)', '2003-08-31 11:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(405118, 34814, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice the way it ends up looking like a bicycle</td>', 'nice the way it ends up looking like a bicycle', '2003-08-31 11:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(405119, 34882, 8779, '<td valign="top">That''s a beauty. But the only nag is that I think that with so much going on in the picture, it''s alittle distracting and my eye keeps moving to find a rest point...<br/> <br/>Perhaps concentrating on the tools and the Introduction booklet?</td>', 'That''s a beauty. But the only nag is that I think that with so much going on in the picture, it''s alittle distracting and my eye keeps moving to find a rest point... Perhaps concentrating on the tools and the Introduction booklet?', '2003-08-31 11:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(405121, 34622, 8779, '<td valign="top">Great macro work! I love the colours! Just a small qu. What is that smudge on the lefthand side? It''s just a little diftracting. =) I am told that when photographing, I should pay careful attention to small details and errors. Perhaps just a quick wipe w/ the cloth?</td>', 'Great macro work! I love the colours! Just a small qu. What is that smudge on the lefthand side? It''s just a little diftracting. =) I am told that when photographing, I should pay careful attention to small details and errors. Perhaps just a quick wipe w/ the cloth?', '2003-08-31 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(405123, 35024, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of apparatus.. Unfortunately it doesnt really work for me. I like the spirit levelly thingy, but the sissors look a little tacky to me.<br/>The grass, very nice green and I see why you chose that as a background, but very diftracting and covers over large areas of the sissors. Perhaps a background with a wooden worktop or perhaps some sandpaper? =)</td>', 'Interesting choice of apparatus.. Unfortunately it doesnt really work for me. I like the spirit levelly thingy, but the sissors look a little tacky to me.The grass, very nice green and I see why you chose that as a background, but very diftracting and covers over large areas of the sissors. Perhaps a background with a wooden worktop or perhaps some sandpaper? =)', '2003-08-31 11:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(405125, 34441, 8779, '<td valign="top">Great stuff. Looks a little scary too! Perhaps a little more contrast? or some way darkening the big saw thingy in the middle so that it sticks out a little more in the steam? I love it still =)</td>', 'Great stuff. Looks a little scary too! Perhaps a little more contrast? or some way darkening the big saw thingy in the middle so that it sticks out a little more in the steam? I love it still =)', '2003-08-31 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(405126, 34790, 8779, '<td valign="top">I love the shape of the pot and the steam.<br/>But the kettle is just missing something.. It just doesnt seem colourful enough and the shape is a little bland. Perhaps zooming out a little more to capture more of the kettle and lots more of that fabulous steam!</td>', 'I love the shape of the pot and the steam.But the kettle is just missing something.. It just doesnt seem colourful enough and the shape is a little bland. Perhaps zooming out a little more to capture more of the kettle and lots more of that fabulous steam!', '2003-08-31 11:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(405127, 35169, 8779, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, and the ruler is great. But perhaps the aperture was a little too wide? I''d have liked to seem more of the ruler, both at the tip and a little further down.<br/>At the mo, the stop of the image is just on big blur. Perhaps you could have just cropped it off, or narrowed the ap? =)</td>', 'I love the idea, and the ruler is great. But perhaps the aperture was a little too wide? I''d have liked to seem more of the ruler, both at the tip and a little further down.At the mo, the stop of the image is just on big blur. Perhaps you could have just cropped it off, or narrowed the ap? =)', '2003-08-31 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(405129, 34688, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting and colourful looking tools. However, the quality of the pic is a little bit of a let down. Also, it would have looked a little neater is the picture was a bit straighter? And perhaps could have tried from different angles to give different perspectives =) It would also have been nice to see the colours a little more..</td>', 'Interesting and colourful looking tools. However, the quality of the pic is a little bit of a let down. Also, it would have looked a little neater is the picture was a bit straighter? And perhaps could have tried from different angles to give different perspectives =) It would also have been nice to see the colours a little more..', '2003-08-31 12:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
