(405383, 34926, 11073, '<td valign="top">i have no doubt that you will have the most commented on pic...and since everyones smart ass comments will be passe by now....I''ll just say good idea, good execution...the male ( you? ) is a little dark and grainy, but it works here.  I hope too many don''t take off for that.  I would have liked to see a different color table or whatever the ruler''s on....a dark table may have worked better imo.  thanks for being creative...another hammer pic was gonna make me slit my wrists...</td>', 'i have no doubt that you will have the most commented on pic...and since everyones smart ass comments will be passe by now....I''ll just say good idea, good execution...the male ( you? ) is a little dark and grainy, but it works here.  I hope too many don''t take off for that.  I would have liked to see a different color table or whatever the ruler''s on....a dark table may have worked better imo.  thanks for being creative...another hammer pic was gonna make me slit my wrists...', '2003-08-31 20:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(405384, 35206, 11073, '<td valign="top">oh man I knew someone would incorporate flowers =`)  although...it''s very well done - i want to not like it...but i can''t - i have to give respect.  the colors are awesome - the angle is good - the composition is there - and the wood adds very good texture.  I may have cropped in a little tighter at the top, but that''s just me.  Very good picture.  Nice work.</td>', 'oh man I knew someone would incorporate flowers =`)  although...it''s very well done - i want to not like it...but i can''t - i have to give respect.  the colors are awesome - the angle is good - the composition is there - and the wood adds very good texture.  I may have cropped in a little tighter at the top, but that''s just me.  Very good picture.  Nice work.', '2003-08-31 20:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(405385, 34990, 11073, '<td valign="top">very nice.  great lighting.</td>', 'very nice.  great lighting.', '2003-08-31 20:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
