(405440, 34703, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Weird looking toothbrush! Good job. One of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Weird looking toothbrush! Good job. One of my favorites for this challenge.', '2003-08-31 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
