(405479, 35139, 7969, '<td valign="top">My vote for blue ribbon, the hand has so much charachter, it really looks as if the has swung the tool its whole life.  I love the ''bronze'' tones, especially against the black.  This is a strong and powerful image in my opinion. Wonderful job!</td>', 'My vote for blue ribbon, the hand has so much charachter, it really looks as if the has swung the tool its whole life.  I love the ''bronze'' tones, especially against the black.  This is a strong and powerful image in my opinion. Wonderful job!', '2003-09-01 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(405484, 35247, 7969, '<td valign="top">Good tones, creative and funny interpretation of the topic. I like that you put a person in with the tool</td>', 'Good tones, creative and funny interpretation of the topic. I like that you put a person in with the tool', '2003-09-01 00:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(405485, 34774, 7969, '<td valign="top">Nice job, long exposure i take it?</td>', 'Nice job, long exposure i take it?', '2003-09-01 00:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
