(405489, 34703, 7969, '<td valign="top">It is certainly (IMO) the water that gets you points here.  The droplets and the stream are all very luring.  good job.</td>', 'It is certainly (IMO) the water that gets you points here.  The droplets and the stream are all very luring.  good job.', '2003-09-01 00:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
