(406757, 35176, 7778, '<td valign="top">The steamy ambiance together with such well-oiled solidy (iron, copper, brass, leather) suggests a hands-on railroad idyll a la Kerouac. Such soiled elegance in black, red and white would credibly be serviced by a man in denim. Having only been a passenger on a train, I can''t tell what the tool is or does. What the image does give me as a whole, is what it must be like (I can almost smell it too) to be a railroader. <br/> <br/>If I strained to find one fault, I''d say the photo weighs a little too much to the left, likely due to the ''very light'' section in the upper right of the picture.</td>', 'The steamy ambiance together with such well-oiled solidy (iron, copper, brass, leather) suggests a hands-on railroad idyll a la Kerouac. Such soiled elegance in black, red and white would credibly be serviced by a man in denim. Having only been a passenger on a train, I can''t tell what the tool is or does. What the image does give me as a whole, is what it must be like (I can almost smell it too) to be a railroader.  If I strained to find one fault, I''d say the photo weighs a little too much to the left, likely due to the ''very light'' section in the upper right of the picture.', '2003-09-02 00:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
