(406965, 34533, 8860, '<td valign="top">This viewpoint is a little too uninteresting, showing too much background and too little focus on the tools and subject. Taking the shot closer, from the table level looking towards the easel may have been more engaging. You could have played with the DOF to focus on either the tools or the painting then.</td>', 'This viewpoint is a little too uninteresting, showing too much background and too little focus on the tools and subject. Taking the shot closer, from the table level looking towards the easel may have been more engaging. You could have played with the DOF to focus on either the tools or the painting then.', '2003-09-02 10:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
