(407018, 35243, 7291, '<td valign="top">.......ouch!</td>', '.......ouch!', '2003-09-02 11:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(407019, 35228, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent background and lighting.</td>', 'Excellent background and lighting.', '2003-09-02 11:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(407020, 34590, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great picture and good eye for catching that contrast.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Great picture and good eye for catching that contrast.  One of my favorites.', '2003-09-02 11:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(407021, 34791, 9273, '<td valign="top">Subject is interesting.  Focus seems a bit soft.  Background is less than inspiring, has severe pincushioning, and could be rotated.</td>', 'Subject is interesting.  Focus seems a bit soft.  Background is less than inspiring, has severe pincushioning, and could be rotated.', '2003-09-02 11:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(407023, 34589, 7291, '<td valign="top">..."If you can''t fix it with duct tape and a hammer....it can''t be fixed!"  Fuuny choice of tool, that really is a multi-purpose tool isn''t it?</td>', '..."If you can''t fix it with duct tape and a hammer....it can''t be fixed!"  Fuuny choice of tool, that really is a multi-purpose tool isn''t it?', '2003-09-02 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(407025, 35227, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very clever putting the leaves in the shovel.  It adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Very clever putting the leaves in the shovel.  It adds a nice touch.', '2003-09-02 12:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(407026, 34475, 10799, '<td valign="top">You might try to have the model a bit more to the side of the picture following the rule of thirds.  Very creative shot.</td>', 'You might try to have the model a bit more to the side of the picture following the rule of thirds.  Very creative shot.', '2003-09-02 12:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(407028, 35151, 2612, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept for the tools challenge. It''s a little difficult to find the subject because the top of the sundial blends so well with the horizontal line defined by the top of the grass. This highlights on the girl''s back also tend to pull away from the sundial.</td>', 'Interesting concept for the tools challenge. It''s a little difficult to find the subject because the top of the sundial blends so well with the horizontal line defined by the top of the grass. This highlights on the girl''s back also tend to pull away from the sundial.', '2003-09-02 12:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(407029, 35050, 7291, '<td valign="top">A lot of action anf the use of fire is always a good bet on DPC.  It looks pretty over exposed but something like this must be hard to shoot as it is.</td>', 'A lot of action anf the use of fire is always a good bet on DPC.  It looks pretty over exposed but something like this must be hard to shoot as it is.', '2003-09-02 12:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(407030, 34680, 7291, '<td valign="top">The border fits nicely with this picture and I like the used look of the drill bit and the worn look of the wood.</td>', 'The border fits nicely with this picture and I like the used look of the drill bit and the worn look of the wood.', '2003-09-02 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(407032, 34774, 2978, '<td valign="top">great work!</td>', 'great work!', '2003-09-02 12:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(407033, 34838, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  It looks like a sky scraper.</td>', 'Great perspective.  It looks like a sky scraper.', '2003-09-02 12:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(407034, 35189, 2612, '<td valign="top">Cool concept! I think the bracelet ot the left is too bright and pulls from the subject, but that is minor.</td>', 'Cool concept! I think the bracelet ot the left is too bright and pulls from the subject, but that is minor.', '2003-09-02 12:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(407038, 34547, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see some humor in some of these shots! I like the textured background, the coloring of the bark and axe are good, and compositionally it is visually appealing. About the only thing I dont really care for is the border. In this particular photograph I feel like it invades my viewing of the photograph, possibly because the crop confines the eyes to that the entire shot and the border distracts from the areas where I need to look - if that makes sense.</td>', 'It''s good to see some humor in some of these shots! I like the textured background, the coloring of the bark and axe are good, and compositionally it is visually appealing. About the only thing I dont really care for is the border. In this particular photograph I feel like it invades my viewing of the photograph, possibly because the crop confines the eyes to that the entire shot and the border distracts from the areas where I need to look - if that makes sense.', '2003-09-02 12:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(407041, 34948, 9809, '<td valign="top">Novel approach -- I like it. Too bad it is fuzzy and has poor lighting.</td>', 'Novel approach -- I like it. Too bad it is fuzzy and has poor lighting.', '2003-09-02 12:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(407044, 34531, 9809, '<td valign="top">The guy is so blown out, he looks like a ghost! Cool.</td>', 'The guy is so blown out, he looks like a ghost! Cool.', '2003-09-02 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(407050, 35021, 7291, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  VERY Cool!  The 4 point start effect worked realyl well here.  a pure black back ground would give this a nice added touch...a rare case of addition by subtraction.</td>', 'WOW!!!  VERY Cool!  The 4 point start effect worked realyl well here.  a pure black back ground would give this a nice added touch...a rare case of addition by subtraction.', '2003-09-02 12:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(407052, 34814, 7291, '<td valign="top">........mmmmmmm.....piiiiiza........*drools on keyboard*</td>', '........mmmmmmm.....piiiiiza........*drools on keyboard*', '2003-09-02 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(407060, 34983, 7291, '<td valign="top">Clever.  Could benefit from brighter lighting.  Bonus points for the willingness to work with those slimy things.</td>', 'Clever.  Could benefit from brighter lighting.  Bonus points for the willingness to work with those slimy things.', '2003-09-02 12:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(407061, 35112, 4747, '<td valign="top">Dunno if this is photography jargin, but here gores.<br/>Nice combination of shapes and textures, shiny and dull surfaces. I can smell the shaved wood.</td>', 'Dunno if this is photography jargin, but here gores.Nice combination of shapes and textures, shiny and dull surfaces. I can smell the shaved wood.', '2003-09-02 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(407064, 35157, 7291, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s an extremely narrow depth of field.  Too narrow perhaps.  There is a lot of the blade that would look nice if it was in focus.</td>', 'Wow, that''s an extremely narrow depth of field.  Too narrow perhaps.  There is a lot of the blade that would look nice if it was in focus.', '2003-09-02 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(407070, 34968, 4747, '<td valign="top">very few people would know what this photo is.. if that''s what you''re going for you did good. I think a little less structured set would have showcased the tools of kink better. I couldn''t figure out why you set everything on a placemat... It took me a full minute to realize the "placemat" was coiled rope.</td>', 'very few people would know what this photo is.. if that''s what you''re going for you did good. I think a little less structured set would have showcased the tools of kink better. I couldn''t figure out why you set everything on a placemat... It took me a full minute to realize the "placemat" was coiled rope.', '2003-09-02 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(407071, 35176, 7291, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot.  Just for fun, I took this picture and converted it to black and white and played with the levels.  It looks great in B&amp;W also.</td>', 'I like this picture a lot.  Just for fun, I took this picture and converted it to black and white and played with the levels.  It looks great in B&W also.', '2003-09-02 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
