(407322, 35035, 7711, '<td valign="top">very good range of tones, I think it works for the image, but I can''t say the same for the focus, though I like the out of focus background, I think I would have liked a little more of the tool in focus, perhaps just the cutting edge, along with the wood.</td>', 'very good range of tones, I think it works for the image, but I can''t say the same for the focus, though I like the out of focus background, I think I would have liked a little more of the tool in focus, perhaps just the cutting edge, along with the wood.', '2003-09-02 19:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
