(407331, 35145, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think shots of hands are great, and they are our tools, but I don''t think the focus is right, nor do I think your lighting choice has played out the strength in your subject, nor does the positioning of them..I appreciate that must have been a tough choice for you to decide upon though! :)</td>', 'I think shots of hands are great, and they are our tools, but I don''t think the focus is right, nor do I think your lighting choice has played out the strength in your subject, nor does the positioning of them..I appreciate that must have been a tough choice for you to decide upon though! :)', '2003-09-02 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(407333, 35064, 2178, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.', '2003-09-02 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
