(407337, 35007, 3102, '<td valign="top">My shot is rather similar, but I think your shot could have been stronger with a little more subtle lighting.  It looks like you used the flash, which reflected quite strongly here.</td>', 'My shot is rather similar, but I think your shot could have been stronger with a little more subtle lighting.  It looks like you used the flash, which reflected quite strongly here.', '2003-09-02 19:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(407338, 35138, 2178, '<td valign="top">Love how the red cloth and chrome tools kick this up a notch from the dull engine compartment.</td>', 'Love how the red cloth and chrome tools kick this up a notch from the dull engine compartment.', '2003-09-02 19:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(407339, 34967, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would also have worked without the walkman and just letting the sheet music be the negative space.</td>', 'I think the composition would also have worked without the walkman and just letting the sheet music be the negative space.', '2003-09-02 19:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(407341, 35042, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s a good concept, but I think you could have done a couple things to make this a little stronger.  The image is overall very flat from a lighting standpoint.  There''s not a lot of contrast.  I might have tried inching the camera up a little bit, and eliminating the very end of the board.  And it might have been cool to have the first couple numbers in focus, leading to a fuzzy background, rather than having a couple random numbers in focus.  Again, it''s a nice idea -- you might toy with this concept a little more :)</td>', 'It''s a good concept, but I think you could have done a couple things to make this a little stronger.  The image is overall very flat from a lighting standpoint.  There''s not a lot of contrast.  I might have tried inching the camera up a little bit, and eliminating the very end of the board.  And it might have been cool to have the first couple numbers in focus, leading to a fuzzy background, rather than having a couple random numbers in focus.  Again, it''s a nice idea -- you might toy with this concept a little more :)', '2003-09-02 19:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(407342, 35048, 2178, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I love your choice of DOF.</td>', 'Nice composition and I love your choice of DOF.', '2003-09-02 19:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(407343, 34711, 7711, '<td valign="top">you''re probably going to laugh, but my first thought was "oh, like sperm fighting to be the one that fertilizes the egg!" Strange, but true. Like the use of tools to convey a message. :)</td>', 'you''re probably going to laugh, but my first thought was "oh, like sperm fighting to be the one that fertilizes the egg!" Strange, but true. Like the use of tools to convey a message. :)', '2003-09-02 19:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(407344, 34648, 3102, '<td valign="top">A great shot!  I''m bumping this one up a notch after more careful review :)  I love having the man in the shot -- he looks very proud of his craft.</td>', 'A great shot!  I''m bumping this one up a notch after more careful review :)  I love having the man in the shot -- he looks very proud of his craft.', '2003-09-02 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
