(407551, 35073, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition, but ruined by the very shallow depth of field. It would be a nice portrait of a pen if it the whole thing was in focus.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition, but ruined by the very shallow depth of field. It would be a nice portrait of a pen if it the whole thing was in focus.', '2003-09-02 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
