(408021, 34965, 9977, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vonautsch:</b></div><hr/><i>Too much yellowish overtone in this picture.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>that''s true, it was 08:30 pm and the sun was very low, the light came from the right and the walls are yellow... (old house I am restoring/refreshing), No flash only natural light....  How to correct that kind (it was really the colors of a late afternoon i seen)...<br/>Thank you for your comments</td>', 'Originally posted by vonautsch:Too much yellowish overtone in this picture. that''s true, it was 08:30 pm and the sun was very low, the light came from the right and the walls are yellow... (old house I am restoring/refreshing), No flash only natural light....  How to correct that kind (it was really the colors of a late afternoon i seen)...Thank you for your comments', '2003-09-03 05:43:54.000000', NULL, 0),
