(420441, 34622, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle tilting of the subject as well as the colors and tones of this extreme macro. Cool stuff!</td>', 'I like the subtle tilting of the subject as well as the colors and tones of this extreme macro. Cool stuff!', '2003-09-16 09:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(423979, 35235, 6458, '<td valign="top">There is, of course, the idea of a vehicle being a tool for transporting people from one place to another. In my opinion a tool is anything humans use that is not built into our bodies. It''s amazing how many people narrowly define words when there are all sorts of other meanings. I bet the people that did not consider this a tool would gladly label a forklift or tractor a tool. *sigh*<br/> <br/>Needless to say, this is a great shot of a tool.</td>', 'There is, of course, the idea of a vehicle being a tool for transporting people from one place to another. In my opinion a tool is anything humans use that is not built into our bodies. It''s amazing how many people narrowly define words when there are all sorts of other meanings. I bet the people that did not consider this a tool would gladly label a forklift or tractor a tool. *sigh* Needless to say, this is a great shot of a tool.', '2003-09-19 14:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
