(427388, 35001, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting spotlights the subjects. Like the shadows and reflections that you were able to capture in your piece. What kind of lighting did you use. Seem like it is producing ridges.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting spotlights the subjects. Like the shadows and reflections that you were able to capture in your piece. What kind of lighting did you use. Seem like it is producing ridges.', '2003-09-23 18:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(427496, 35001, 11432, '<td valign="top">The lighting used is two Source Four theatrical lighting instruments. They have 575 watt blubs in them, the ridges are the reflector showing up due to low intensity from the Source Four. The setup picture is here: <a href="//www.agapecomputerservices.com/dpchallenge.cfm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.agapecomputerservices.com/dpchallenge.cfm</a> <br/>Once again thanks for the Comments.</td>', 'The lighting used is two Source Four theatrical lighting instruments. They have 575 watt blubs in them, the ridges are the reflector showing up due to low intensity from the Source Four. The setup picture is here: //www.agapecomputerservices.com/dpchallenge.cfm Once again thanks for the Comments.', '2003-09-23 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
