(435676, 34453, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very graphic. The overblown lighting really helps to make the image pop out of the picture. Love the shadow under the knife, almost makes it look like its floating. Great details and shadows in the handle of the knife. <br/> <br/>The reflections and shadows on the droplets of blood really help to make it look like real blood.</td>', 'Very graphic. The overblown lighting really helps to make the image pop out of the picture. Love the shadow under the knife, almost makes it look like its floating. Great details and shadows in the handle of the knife.  The reflections and shadows on the droplets of blood really help to make it look like real blood.', '2003-09-30 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
