(676771, 35001, 16269, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, and I really appreicate that you showed the setup. I took a look at it and just thought, "whoah!" Like I''ve said many times now.. I''m not much of a photographer.. I''ve never thought about actually setting up a shot.. or what kind of results you could get. I just go out and see what there is to see and snap it. hehe. This photo is very cool and appealing to the eye.</td>', 'I really like this picture, and I really appreicate that you showed the setup. I took a look at it and just thought, "whoah!" Like I''ve said many times now.. I''m not much of a photographer.. I''ve never thought about actually setting up a shot.. or what kind of results you could get. I just go out and see what there is to see and snap it. hehe. This photo is very cool and appealing to the eye.', '2004-04-20 01:22:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(735508, 35001, 22192, '<td valign="top">Well, imagine my surprise.  Just doing a search on lighting wrench and look what I found.  Thought it was sort of interesting, then noticed the "Trash Day" title, and then I had to get really close to the screen!  (ok, so I could have zoomed the image, but you know me . . .)  Really enjoyed reading the comments - especially regarding the question of purpose for the gloves!</td>', 'Well, imagine my surprise.  Just doing a search on lighting wrench and look what I found.  Thought it was sort of interesting, then noticed the "Trash Day" title, and then I had to get really close to the screen!  (ok, so I could have zoomed the image, but you know me . . .)  Really enjoyed reading the comments - especially regarding the question of purpose for the gloves!', '2004-05-25 17:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
